(property "Description" " | design | Upright below U316.3 on the bottom side, pad 2 (GND) in the 7-via GND cluster it shares with U316.2 (W2 CTRL-6, review RV-CTRL6-E2-1). Pad 1 reaches U316 IN only through U316.3 (EN) and the 0.4 mm EN-IN jumper under the SOT-23-6 body (about 5.7 mm of copper), not directly at the IN pin as SLVS841G Table 5-1 and section 9.4.1 ask: OPEN (review RV-CTRL6-E2-4, build/15), recipe with RV-CTRL6-E-8 at the next CTRL re-placement." (at 0 0 0) (effects (font (size 1.016 1.016)) (hide yes)))
