(property "Description" " | design | W2 CTRL-6 (orchestrator decision on build/15 \"Ключ повітродувки Q305 при КЗ\", option (2)): the blower loop is behind the PTC F303, so a short with Q305 on carries at most the PTC current: Itrip 2.20 A at 23 C, about 2.86 A at -20 C and 3.18 A at -40 C (Ihold ratio, an assumption); with AO3400A Rev 3.1 (read 2026-11-22) RDS(on) < 48 mOhm at VGS 2.5 V and RthJA 125 C/W max, TJ is about 21 C at -40 C, 56 C at 23 C and 85 C at 70 C ambient while the PTC holds its trip current (MODEL); the pulse before the trip is in build/15." (at 0 0 0) (effects (font (size 1.016 1.016)) (hide yes)))
