(property "Reference" "U316" (at 0 0 0) (effects (font (size 1.016 1.016)) ))
(property "Value" "TPS2553DBVR" (at 0 -2.54 0) (effects (font (size 1.016 1.016)) ))
(property "Footprint" "Package_TO_SOT_SMD:SOT-23-6" (at 0 0 0) (effects (font (size 1.016 1.016)) (hide yes)))
(property "Datasheet" "https://www.ti.com/lit/ds/symlink/tps2553.pdf" (at 0 0 0) (effects (font (size 1.016 1.016)) (hide yes)))
(property "Description" " | design | W2 CTRL-6 (W2 CTRL-5 decision, build/15 \"Захист VSYS Pico за D301\"; reviews RV4-E-3, RV4-S-1): constant-current TPS2553DBVR (no -1) ahead of D301, so that with LAB5 as the only source a short of the Pico VSYS, of C307 or inside the Pico module is limited to IOS 0.165-0.223 A with RILIM R397 140k 1 % (SLVS841G Rev. G, Oct 2026, eq. 1 and 3, https://www.ti.com/lit/ds/symlink/tps2553.pdf, read 2026-11-22; 150k of the first W2 CTRL-6 commit replaced after review RV-CTRL6-E-1) and the 0.15 mm E3_PICO_VSYS copper (0.224-0.248 A at +20 C on L2/L3, +19.8 C at 0.223 A on 0.0152 mm foil, MODEL) then carries at most its rating; it recovers by itself when the fault clears (a -1 part could latch off on the start into the VSYS capacitance). Not covered (review RV-CTRL6-E2-3, OPEN in build/15): with USB connected for programming (U305 note) the module VBUS feeds VSYS through the Pico's own Schottky D1 (Raspberry Pi Pico datasheet Release 22, build 19/11/2026, section 4.4, read 2026-11-23), so a short of C307 or of the U305.39-C307 branch (0.15 mm, partly on L2/L3) draws the USB source current through CTRL copper that U316 does not limit (+124 C at 0.5 A on the 0.0152 mm inner foil, MODEL). EN tied to IN: on whenever LAB5 is present, like U553 in design/E5.json.; DBV SOT-23-6 per SLVS841G pin functions: 1 IN, 2 GND, 3 EN, 4 FAULT, 5 ILIM, 6 OUT. FAULT is an active-low open-drain output and is left unconnected (no input reads it; a VSYS fault shows as a Pico brown-out). IN takes the 0.1 uF ceramic C344 to GND as close to the IC as possible (pin function table).; Accept LCSC lots only with marking 2553 (parts.json U-TPS2553DBVR); never the latch-off -1 part here." (at 0 0 0) (effects (font (size 1.016 1.016)) (hide yes)))
