(text "E3-03 — OPEN, блокує випуск — STACK §5.6; §8 (тепло); §8.1 (потік повітря)" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 334.01 263.35 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27) (bold yes) (color 170 0 0 1)) (justify left top)) (uuid 780c1139-0e01-57ec-9c5f-c47432a00d48))
(text "BOM candidate Delta BFB0305HA-C is selected; final mechanical fit, installed airflow, start/stall current,\nLAB5 concurrency and noise remain unqualified.\nВорота (стенд): Fit the body envelope 30.5x30.5x10.5 mm plus duct/lead clearance into CAD before cutting the\nenclosure. Measure the 0.25 A design continuous reserve and the provisional 0.50 A startup limit rather than\nclaiming peak from the datasheet. Confirm LAB5 within E1-05 (<=3.2 A continuous, <=4 A transient with default\nD36V50F5 + F102 4 A) in allowed concurrency; over budget means a formal concurrency cap per R-E2-17. Run the\n45 min closed-cover solar thermal test and RF A/B noise checks; inlet drop <=5 Pa at the required flow." (at 334.01 265.45 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid abac3215-9025-5418-9d5c-6f2447b4daab))
